  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Still in the field. The expedition went out to re-occupy a transect laid in 2258 and to repeat its measurements exactly, which required finding a beacon that had been left running and, against all expectation, was still running. The team moved into it rather than deploy a shelter and has been there since. Its measurements so far agree with the originals to within instrument error, which is the most boring possible result and the one everybody wanted.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
